  "text": "DESCRIPTION\nAntigen–Antibody\nconfidence: high\nThis structure is a complex between a single-domain antibody fragment (VHH/nanobody) and its protein antigen. Chain B is annotated as a VHH antibody fragment, while chain A is the bound target protein. The complex is stabilized by a substantial interface between the two chains. No organism or specific function can be assigned from the provided summary because no homology or UniProt annotations were available.\nReasoningThe structure contains a 128-residue VHH antibody fragment on chain B and a 118-residue protein antigen on chain A. The suggested interface shows 51 contacts between these chains, consistent with a biologically relevant antigen-antibody complex. No catalytic, nucleic-acid-binding, or receptor-ligand evidence is present.\nChain A · protein\nChain B · protein · VHH\nHOMOLOGS\nSearched by antigen sequence similarity\nNo significant homologs found.\nANNOTATIONS\nCDR numbering\nIMGT\nKabat\nChothia\nCDR\n3 residues · IMGT\nB:26-33\nB:51-58\nB:97-117\nParatope\n18 residues · structure\nB:LYS27\nB:SER29\nB:SER30\nB:ARG32\nB:ASP99\nB:SER100\nB:PHE101\nB:GLU102\nB:ASP103\nB:PRO104\nB:THR105\nB:LEU108\nB:VAL109\nB:SER111\nB:GLY113\nB:ALA114\nB:PHE115\nB:GLN116\nEpitope\n19 residues · structure\nA:ILE38\nA:TYR40\nA:GLU42\nA:ASP45\nA:ASN47\nA:GLN50\nA:VAL52\nA:HIS53\nA:ASP57\nA:VAL60\nA:ARG97\nA:MET99\nA:SER101\nA:GLY103\nA:GLY104\nA:ALA105\nA:ASP106\nA:TYR107\nA:ARG109\nINTERACTION NETWORK\nTable\n2D\nChain A\nChain B\n2.52Å\n3.06Å\n3.08Å\n3.25Å\n3.14Å\n3.17Å\n3.19Å\n2.37Å\n2.60Å\n3.48Å\n3.49Å\n3.81Å\n3.14Å\n3.30Å\n3.04Å\n3.17Å\n2.60Å\n3.08Å\n3.70Å\n3.48Å\n3.25Å\n3.32Å\n2.69Å\n3.29Å\n3.62Å\n3.83Å\n3.14Å\n3.54Å\n3.01Å\n3.73Å\n3.81Å\n3.46Å\n3.71Å\n3.21Å\n3.60Å\n3.60Å\n3.25Å\n3.70Å\n3.44Å\n3.44Å\n3.71Å\n3.50Å\n3.49Å\n5.16Å\nARG\nA109\nGLN\nA50\nASP\nA45\nTYR\nA40\nARG\nA97\nGLU\nA42\nILE\nA38\nVAL\nA52\nASP\nA57\nVAL\nA60\nMET\nA99\nGLY\nA103\nGLY\nA104\nALA\nA105\nASP\nA106\nTYR\nA107\nGLN\nB116\nTHR\nB10